      "task_item": "",
      "content": "\n## Issue\nMainMenu component needs to:\n1. Display all available apps in a list\n2. Ensure each app has a proper route for single/detail view\n3. Remove or handle desktop-only apps appropriately\n\n## Requirements\n- List all apps available in the system\n- Create/verify routes for single app view (app/:id or similar)\n- Remove desktop-specific dependencies that block mobile/single view\n- Ensure smooth navigation between apps\n- Handle missing or unavailable apps gracefully\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\u2713 All apps listed in MainMenu\n\u2713 Each app has a functioning single-view route\n\u2713 No desktop-only blocking for mobile users\n\u2713 Navigation between apps works smoothly\n\u2713 Links don't break when navigating between single app views\n\u2713 Proper error handling for missing apps",
